%S A401109 1,3,38,502,6966,99451,1446276,21307543,316955332,4749930456,
%T A401109 71604121914,1084607831817,16494376384812,251684120845518,
%U A401109 3851413646300654,59082639033041761,908318527200265318,13990806892805351513,215864086497424249772,3335590688502951034211
%N A401109 Number of compositions of 4*n in which the sum of the even parts equals the sum of the odd parts.
%C A401109 Both sums are equal to 2*n. The empty composition is counted for n = 0.
%C A401109 No composition of a positive integer not divisible by 4 has this property.
%H A401109 Alois P. Heinz, <a href="/A401109/b401109.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..834</a>
%F A401109 a(n) = [x^(2*n)] (1-x^2)^2*(2-x-2*x^2)^(n-1)/(1-x-x^2)^(n+1) for n >= 1; a(0) = 1.
%F A401109 a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} Sum_{j=1..n} binomial(k+2*j,k)*binomial(n-1,k-1)*binomial(n+j-1,2*j-1) for n >= 1.
%e A401109 a(1) = 3, corresponding to (2,1,1), (1,2,1), and (1,1,2). In each composition, the even parts sum to 2 and the odd parts sum to 2.
%Y A401109 Cf. A239261 (partitions), A098123 (compositions with equal numbers of even and odd parts).
%K A401109 nonn
%O A401109 0,2
%A A401109 _Vladeta Jovovic_, Oct 14 2026
